{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Da Mao (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the male panda <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Da_Mao_and_Er_Shun\" title=\"Da Mao and Er Shun\">Da Mao</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> replaced Er Shun's female companion after zoologists discovered that Er Shun was actually female?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Da_Mao_and_Er_Shun","retrieved":1793013882247},{"title":"Somyev language (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Somyev_language\" title=\"Somyev language\">Somyev language</a></b>, spoken by just two people in 2010, became endangered due in part to the importation of hoes?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Somyev_language","retrieved":1793013882271},{"title":"How to DAD (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/How_to_DAD\" title=\"How to DAD\">How to DAD</a></b> has made a video titled \"How to get a baby to clean the house\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/How_to_DAD","retrieved":1793013882273},{"title":"Rossini in Wildbad (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rossini_in_Wildbad\" title=\"Rossini in Wildbad\">Rossini in Wildbad</a></b> is an annual festival of <i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bel_canto\" title=\"Bel canto\">bel canto</a></i> opera held at the spa in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bad_Wildbad\" title=\"Bad Wildbad\">Bad Wildbad</a>, where <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gioachino_Rossini\" title=\"Gioachino Rossini\">Gioachino Rossini</a> stayed in 1856?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rossini_in_Wildbad","retrieved":1793013882274},{"title":"the first Afro-Cuban woman elected to the Congress of Cuba (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Esperanza_Sánchez_Mastrapa\" title=\"Esperanza Sánchez Mastrapa\">the first Afro-Cuban woman elected to the Congress of Cuba</a></b> was both a communist and a pharmacist?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Esperanza_S%C3%A1nchez_Mastrapa","retrieved":1793013882276},{"title":"Rider Tavern (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the Marquis de Lafayette stopped at the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rider_Tavern\" title=\"Rider Tavern\">Rider Tavern</a></b> during <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Visit_of_the_Marquis_de_Lafayette_to_the_United_States\" title=\"Visit of the Marquis de Lafayette to the United States\">his 1824 US tour</a> and reviewed the local militia?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rider_Tavern","retrieved":1793013882279},{"title":"Todoroki Hajime (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Todoroki_Hajime\" title=\"Todoroki Hajime\">Todoroki Hajime</a></b><span class=\"nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">'</span>s</span> viral song \"Konkokonkonkonkonkonkon\" derives from a noise that she made while playing a horror game?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Todoroki_Hajime","retrieved":1793013882281},{"title":"Ordinary World (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Billie_Joe_Armstrong\" title=\"Billie Joe Armstrong\">Billie Joe Armstrong</a> smashed eight guitars while filming <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ordinary_World_(film)\" title=\"Ordinary World (film)\">Ordinary World</a></b></i><span style=\"padding-left:0.15em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span></span>","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ordinary_World_(film)","retrieved":1793013882284},{"title":"Invention Secrecy Act (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the U.S. government can use the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Invention_Secrecy_Act\" title=\"Invention Secrecy Act\">Invention Secrecy Act</a></b> to make new inventions classified?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Invention_Secrecy_Act","retrieved":1793013882285},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt8\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{color:white;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .banner-image{position:relative;max-width:1125px;height:auto;margin-bottom:.6em}.mw-parser-output .banner-image img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-wide{width:80%}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-left,.mw-parser-output .banner-box-right{padding:8px 7px;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px;width:40%}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-left{text-align:left}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-right{text-align:right}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-2{position:absolute;z-index:2;min-width:20em}@media screen and (min-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .banner-image img.nolink{display:none}.mw-parser-output .banner-image span[typeof~=\"mw:File/Frameless\"].nolink{display:none}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2{font-size:190%}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{font-size:150%}.mw-parser-output .banner-image{overflow:hidden}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-left{left:3%}